  "semantic_changes": [
    "Select the official production server branch unconditionally; TEST_SURFACE_UPDATE is not a browser feature.",
    "Extend the nonempty dirty-region TPtrC8 descriptor lifetime through synchronous SubmitUpdate IPC; retain the same descriptor bytes and IPC slots.",
    "Connect first to the protected !SURFACE_UPDATE_SERVER name that later firmware (the Nokia 808) registers, and to SURFACE_UPDATE_SERVER only when that name is not found; the version, slots and protocol are unchanged."
  ],
  "preserved_semantics": [
    "Direct RSessionBase CreateSession to !SURFACE_UPDATE_SERVER, else SURFACE_UPDATE_SERVER, using TVersion(1,1,3), caller slot count, default 6",
    "All nine frozen exported entries implemented locally (constructor C1/C2 plus seven other public functions)",
    "Original IPC opcodes, argument positions, descriptor bytes, notification cache, validation, completion, cancellation and Close precondition",
    "Version and IssueRequestComplete implementations retained",
    "No version retry, negotiation, firmware replacement, capability change or runtime instrumentation; the only retry is the server name fallback"
  ],
